         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">If you're self-employed, have more complex tax affairs and your annual business turnover was Â£90,000 or more, use the full version of the Self-employment supplementary page when filing a tax return for the tax year ended 5 April 2025</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
